   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S031",
  "still": "E01-S031",
  "dur": 11.03,
  "gen": 12,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "bean",
   "luna",
   "gus"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "pip",
    "text": "Are you okay, Gus?",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 1.49
   },
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "I'm fine! I did that on purpose!",
    "start": 2.39,
    "length": 3.84
   },
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Did you slip, Gus?",
    "start": 6.63,
    "length": 3.4
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S032",
  "still": "E01-S031",
  "dur": 6.05,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "slow_push",
  "chars": [
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "bean",
   "luna",
   "gus"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "No! I was testing the water. It's wet. Very wet.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.55
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S033",
  "still": "E01-S033",
  "dur": 11.86,
  "gen": 12,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gus",
   "ollie",
   "pip"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Your bucket water sank into the sand.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 2.15
   },
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "It was already wet, so it doesn't count!",
    "start": 3.05,
    "length": 2.38
   },
   {
    "char": "pip",
    "text": "Maybe buckets can't bring the sea back.",
    "start": 5.83,
    "length": 2.57
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S035",
  "still": "E01-S035",
  "dur": 6.05,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "slow_push",
  "chars": [
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "bean"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "We need help. Let's ask Gran Mari.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.55
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S036",
  "still": "E01-S036",
  "dur": 9.89,
  "gen": 10,
  "camera": "pan_up",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "Well now, a soggy seagull and a worried otter. What's all this?",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 8.39
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S036b",
  "still": "E01-S036",
  "dur": 6.54,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Gran Mari, why does the water go away?",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 5.04
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S036c",
  "still": "E01-S036",
  "dur": 9.61,
  "gen": 10,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "Oh, that is a good question, Ollie. Let's find out together.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 8.11
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S038",
  "still": "E01-S038",
  "dur": 12.07,
  "gen": 13,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "ollie",
   "pip"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "This bowl is a pretend ocean. Watch the water, and watch slowly.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 10.57
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S039",
  "still": "E01-S039",
  "dur": 7.0,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "top_down",
  "chars": [
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "It moves! High on one side, low on the other!",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 5.4
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S040",
  "still": "E01-S040",
  "dur": 11.11,
  "gen": 12,
  "camera": "tilt_up",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "pip"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "See the moon? It pulls on the sea, just a little. Like a very gentle tug.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 9.61
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S040b",
  "still": "E01-S040",
  "dur": 6.56,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "pip"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "pip",
    "text": "So the moon makes the water go up and down?",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 5.06
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S040c",
  "still": "E01-S040",
  "dur": 11.11,
  "gen": 12,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari",
   "pip"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "Yes. The water rises up the beach. Then it slides back out. Two times every day.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 9.61
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S041",
  "still": "E01-S041",
  "dur": 7.0,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "timelapse",
  "chars": [
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "The water didn't run away! It's just out for a while!",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 3.57
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S043",
  "still": "E01-S043",
  "dur": 9.0,
  "gen": 9,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "luna",
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "gus",
   "gran_mari"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "So how long until it comes back?",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 3.5
   },
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "Well now, what do you think happens next?",
    "start": 4.4,
    "length": 3.6
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S043b",
  "still": "E01-S043",
  "dur": 5.67,
  "gen": 6,
  "camera": "slow_push",
  "chars": [
   "luna",
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "gus",
   "gran_mari"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "It slides back to the beach!",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.17
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S044",
  "still": "E01-S044",
  "dur": 9.28,
  "gen": 10,
  "camera": "top_down",
  "chars": [
   "gran_mari"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gran_mari",
    "text": "The sea keeps its own clock. We can't hurry it. But we can watch it.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 7.78
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S046",
  "still": "E01-S046",
  "dur": 12.1,
  "gen": 13,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Try it at home! Put water in a bowl. Tilt it very slowly. Watch the water climb one side. Watch it slide away from the other.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 10.6
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S047",
  "still": "E01-S047",
  "dur": 7.67,
  "gen": 8,
  "camera": "wide",
  "chars": [
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "This is our water line. We wait and we watch.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 6.17
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S051",
  "still": "E01-S051",
  "dur": 8.77,
  "gen": 9,
  "camera": "timelapse",
  "chars": [
   "gus",
   "bean"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "I can't wait anymore! I'll go get the sea myself!",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.84
   },
   {
    "char": "bean",
    "text": "Wait!",
    "start": 5.74,
    "length": 2.03
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S052",
  "still": "E01-S052",
  "dur": 9.88,
  "gen": 10,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "gus",
   "bean",
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "Okay, okay. I fibbed before. My bucket water didn't count. It all sank away.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 5.82
   },
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "I'm sorry I said it was already wet.",
    "start": 6.72,
    "length": 2.16
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S052b",
  "still": "E01-S052",
  "dur": 3.76,
  "gen": 4,
  "camera": "slow_push",
  "chars": [
   "gus",
   "bean",
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Thanks for telling us the truth, Gus.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 2.26
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S054",
  "still": "E01-S054",
  "dur": 9.76,
  "gen": 10,
  "camera": "wide",
  "chars": [
   "luna",
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "bean",
   "gus"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "pip",
    "text": "It came back all by itself!",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 3.32
   },
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Gran Mari was right! We waited and watched!",
    "start": 4.22,
    "length": 4.54
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S056",
  "still": "E01-S056",
  "dur": 7.26,
  "gen": 8,
  "camera": "static",
  "chars": [
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "bean",
   "luna"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Time for my Wonder Pocket! Three things we learned.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 5.76
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S058",
  "still": "E01-S058",
  "dur": 5.67,
  "gen": 6,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "One. The moon gently pulls on the sea.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.17
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S059",
  "still": "E01-S059",
  "dur": 6.53,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Two. The water goes up and down two times a day.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 5.03
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S060",
  "still": "E01-S060",
  "dur": 7.67,
  "gen": 8,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "Three. The sea always comes back. We just have to wait.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 6.17
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S061",
  "still": "E01-S061",
  "dur": 6.03,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "close",
  "chars": [
   "ollie",
   "luna"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "ollie",
    "text": "And one kind thing to try today. Wait for a friend.",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.28
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "shot": "E01-S062",
  "still": "E01-S062",
  "dur": 6.34,
  "gen": 7,
  "camera": "wide",
  "chars": [
   "ollie",
   "pip",
   "bean",
   "gus",
   "luna"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "char": "gus",
    "text": "Bye, everybody! Next time, I'll wait too!",
    "start": 0.5,
    "length": 4.84
   }
  ]
 }
]